d Use:</strong> RinkBolt's use and transfer to any other app of information received from Google APIs will adhere to the <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" class="font-semibold">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including the Limited Use requirements.` },
